            "text": "{\"title\":\"Lebanese Spiced Chickpea and Eggplant Stew\",\"readyInMinutes\":45,\"servings\":4,\"summary\":\"This hearty and authentic \u003cb\u003eLebanese spiced chickpea and eggplant stew\u003c/b\u003e offers a deeply satisfying, comforting meal that is entirely plant-based and packed with rich Mediterranean flavors. Soft roasted eggplant pieces melt into a fragrant, savory tomato base that has been lovingly infused with warm ground cumin, aromatic coriander, and a subtle hint of sweet cinnamon. Tender chickpeas add incredible substance and plant protein, making this vibrant dish a complete dinner option when served alongside warm toasted flatbread or fluffy grain bulgur. Freshly chopped mint leaves scattered over the top right before serving create a striking contrast of brightness that perfectly lifts the deep spice notes. Ideal for busy weeknight dinners or meal preparation for the days ahead, this healthy vegetarian stew tastes even better the next day as the earthy seasonings continue to harmonize. Enjoy a traditional taste of Middle Eastern home cooking with minimal preparation effort and clean, nourishing ingredients that celebrate the very best of seasonal Levantine vegetable cooking.\",\"nutrition\":{\"nutrients\":[{\"name\":\"Calories\",\"amount\":310.0,\"unit\":\"kcal\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":15.5},{\"name\":\"Fat\",\"amount\":9.5,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":14.6},{\"name\":\"Saturated Fat\",\"amount\":1.3,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":6.5},{\"name\":\"Carbohydrates\",\"amount\":48.0,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":16.0},{\"name\":\"Sugar\",\"amount\":11.2,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":12.4},{\"name\":\"Protein\",\"amount\":12.4,\"unit\":\"g\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":24.8},{\"name\":\"Cholesterol\",\"amount\":0.0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":0.0},{\"name\":\"Sodium\",\"amount\":680.0,\"unit\":\"mg\",\"percentOfDailyNeeds\":29.6},{\"name\":\"Fiber\",\"amount\":13.5,\"unit\":\"g\",\"per